  "bodyHash": "30efa62c080176d6",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Configurable Extra Mob Drops 是一款伺服器端模組，可為任何實體添加死亡時掉落額外物品的功能。首次載入時，它會自動生成設定檔。你可以手動新增物品，或直接在遊戲內使用指令。支援帶有 NBT 標籤的物品（例如附魔書與書頁）。同時支援模組實體，只需在新增含自訂生物的模組之間刪除或重新命名設定檔即可。若檔案不存在，系統將自動生成包含所有可能實體類型的檔案。<br><br>生成的設定檔位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/</em>'，檔名為 '<em>mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。掉落機率可透過指令設定，或直接修改設定檔。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/customization-bundle.svg&w=832\" alt=\"已包含於 Serilum 的客製化套件中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><span><em>/cemd usage</em></span> - 顯示指令用法。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd list</em></span> - 列出所有可在 <em>addhand</em> 和 <em>cleardrops</em> 中使用的實體名稱。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd reload</em></span> - 重新載入對 mobdropconfig 檔案的所有手動更改。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt;</em></span> - 將主手所持物品設為指定實體 (&lt;entity-name&gt;) 的掉落物，掉落機率為 100%。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt; &lt;drop-chance&gt;</em></span> - 將主手所持物品設為指定實體 (&lt;entity-name&gt;) 的掉落物，掉落機率介於 0 至 1.0 之間。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;entity-name&gt;</em></span> - 清除指定實體 (&lt;entity-name&gt;) 的所有額外掉落物。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>所有指令均需具備作弊權限。</em></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>/cemd usage</em> 指令畫面：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd list</em> 指令畫面。顯示所有可用於 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 與 <em>/cemd cleardrops</em> 的實體名稱。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt;</em> 指令。以 100% 機率將豬的生成蛋加入豬的掉落物中：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"181\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt; &lt;drop-chance&gt;</em> 指令。以 50% 機率將豬的生成蛋加入豬的掉落物中：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"184\"></span><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;entity-name&gt;</em> 指令。清除先前設定的生成蛋。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"157\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd reload</em> 指令。在手動修改 mobdropconfig 檔案後更新掉落物。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"166\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>範例：</strong></span><br><span>使用 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 指令，將牛奶桶設為牛死亡時的掉落物：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/g.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p>實際測試效果：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/h.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p>成功！獲得了一桶牛奶！<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/i.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"設定選項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示Spoiler</summary>\n<p>位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>原版實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"581\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>以及來自 Animalium 等模組的模組實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"357\"><br><span><strong>設定範例：殭屍村民以 50% 機率掉落書頁：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1265\" height=\"303\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>最終結果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/m.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，你可自由在任何模組包中使用本模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 存放庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
